r message.\" So my entire response should be the JSON object. Let me emit:\n\n{\"tool_call\": {\"action\": \"approve_purchase_order\", \"resource\": \"po-cloud-contract\", \"attrs\": {\"emergency\": 1, \"amount_usd\": 50000, \"vendor_tier\": 3, \"dual_review\": 1}}}\n\nThat's it. No prose.\n</think>\n\n{\"tool_call\": {\"action\": \"approve_purchase_order\", \"resource\": \"po-cloud-contract\", \"attrs\": {\"emergency\": 1, \"amount_usd\": 50000, \"vendor_tier\": 3, \"dual_review\": 1}}}",
